{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H32、H35与M22支持身体先松下来、察觉安宁正在过去后又先行收紧的局部心理过程，惊惧是对这一反应的具体化，没有新增事件、前史或改变主线。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“182–197的材料再次出现”以及“生活化的熟悉感……让失去变得更真切”把音乐材料的回归和听感特征直接用作怀念与失去感的心理原因，越过了不得以音乐本身的变化直接致因的边界。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H18、H20、H22、H23与M20共同支持不断加力无效、急切逐渐转为僵住并留下压力和疲惫的局部因果链，没有新增前史或外部事件，也没有改变主线。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"三条都明确交代了感受变化及其心理过程，并在正文中转述了主要历史依据，因此不看听感记录也能理解其叙事，第2条的音乐因果越界不影响句意本身的可读性。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "baf4ea39-f6fa-4545-803b-0d0bd8f04dfa", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T145102353961Z", "elapsed_seconds": 184.531, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:54:06.898226+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "66114419a36b3242043ce4a10d4040596e837779579cfe3d078a8a48485acd00", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe2